{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42301","headline":"送礼部潘尚书致仕还建安 · 徐铉","name":"送礼部潘尚书致仕还建安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名遂功成累复轻，鲈鱼因起旧乡情。\n履声初下金华省，帆影看离石首城。\n化劒津头寻故老，同亭会上问仙卿。\n冥鸿高举真难事，相送何须泪满缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}